*---------------------------------------------------------------
* timer.equ -- the timer mode constants.
*
* HOISTED OUT OF timer.s (S9 L4, 2026-08-30). Merlin-8's `ENT`
* exports code labels only -- an EQUATE cannot cross the linker
* -- so a constant two REL modules both name has to be shared at
* ASSEMBLY time, through a put file. Equates emit nothing, so
* the move is byte-neutral; check-bytes is the proof.
*---------------------------------------------------------------
TIMER_MD_COOP  equ  3
